//
// Lint waivers for the nortl-generated engines, passed to "make lint-verilog"
// via LINT_WAIVERS.
//
// UNSIGNED fires ~60 times on the generated comparisons against zero and means
// nothing about the design. It cannot be scoped to the generated files: it is
// raised during elaboration, where "lint_off -file" no longer matches, and
// 5.046 accepts neither -module nor -match on lint_off. The pin wrapper
// contains no comparisons, so nothing hand-written is covered today.

`verilator_config

lint_off -rule UNSIGNED
